flowchart TB
    Receipt[Receive stock with unique reference] --> Transaction[Database transaction]
    Order[Reserve order units] --> Transaction
    Cancel[Release pre-dispatch reservation] --> Transaction
    Delivered[Deduct on hand and reserved at delivery] --> Transaction
    Count[Audited stock count adjustment] --> Transaction
    Transaction --> Balances[(Product and warehouse balances)]
    Transaction --> Ledger[(Movement ledger)]
    Balances --> Available[Available equals on hand minus reserved]
    Available --> Reports[Inventory reports and current dashboard]
    Available --> Snapshot[Stock snapshot when forecast runs]
